#: b23a37185f6b4844aa1089b0fa5f408f
msgid ""
"CI also runs `brew install --adopt` for the SignalWire formulas "
"(overwrite a conflicting cellar install). The runner-only `brew uninstall"
" cmake` step is **not** needed on a developer Mac."
msgstr ""
"CI 还会对 SignalWire formulas 运行 `brew install --adopt`（覆盖冲突的 cellar 安装）。仅针对"
" runner 的 `brew uninstall cmake` 步骤在开发者 Mac 上**不需要**。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/02-build.md:104
#: 9a592f789d1e458baee81d5196340aa9
msgid ""
"On Apple Silicon, Homebrew lives under `/opt/homebrew`. `ffmpeg@7` and "
"`libpq@18` are keg-only; CI force-links them so `pkg-config` / "
"`configure` see them. If you skip the force-link, add those prefixes to "
"`PKG_CONFIG_PATH` (and often `PATH` / `LDFLAGS`) before `./configure`."
msgstr ""
"在 Apple Silicon 上，Homebrew 位于 `/opt/homebrew`。`ffmpeg@7` 和 `libpq@18` 是 "
"keg-only 软件包；CI 会强制链接它们，使 `pkg-config` / `configure` 能够找到。如果跳过强制链接，请在 "
"`./configure` 前将这些前缀加入 `PKG_CONFIG_PATH`（通常还要加入 `PATH` / `LDFLAGS`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/02-build.md:106
#: 73a1d722dda1472491ff66f94927673b
msgid "Configure, build, install"
msgstr "配置、构建、安装"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/02-build.md:108
#: d8125de3f32b4d42af0b71b05c6dff2f
msgid ""
"Use a home prefix so you do not need root. The command below uses "
"`--disable-fhs` so the installed `bin/`, `conf/`, `mod/`, `db/`, `log/`, "
"and `run/` directories stay below `$HOME/fs`. Default without `--prefix` "
"is `/usr/local/freeswitch` (`configure.ac`). macOS CI uses "
"`--prefix=…/OUT` plus `--enable-shared --enable-static` and therefore "
"follows its FHS-style output paths."
msgstr ""
"使用家目录前缀即可无需 root。下面的命令使用 `--disable-fhs`，因此安装后的 "
"`bin/`、`conf/`、`mod/`、`db/`、`log/` 和 `run/` 目录都位于 `$HOME/fs` 下。不带 "
"`--prefix` 时默认前缀为 `/usr/local/freeswitch`（`configure.ac`）。macOS CI 使用 "
"`--prefix=…/OUT` 加上 `--enable-shared --enable-static`，因此遵循 FHS 风格的输出路径。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/02-build.md:123
#: 1bdf7c04bf4f4af18b5aeffd3e1dab6a
msgid ""
"`bootstrap.sh` copies `build/modules.conf.in` → `modules.conf` if "
"missing, then runs Autotools. `-j` parallelizes bundled library "
"bootstraps."
msgstr ""
"如果 `modules.conf` 不存在，`bootstrap.sh` 会复制 `build/modules.conf.in` → "
"`modules.conf`，然后运行 Autotools。`-j` 会并行执行捆绑库的 bootstrap。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/02-build.md:124
#: 235d01b0fa8b4b74b1165c5c9014bae3
msgid ""
"Edit **`modules.conf`** (build list: `src/mod/...` lines) **after** "
"bootstrap and **before** `./configure` / `make`. Runtime load is a "
"separate file: `modules.conf.xml`. A compiled module can still be "
"unloaded."
msgstr ""
"请在 bootstrap **之后**、`./configure` / `make` **之前**编辑 "
"**`modules.conf`**（构建列表：`src/mod/...` "
"行）。运行时加载使用另一个文件：`modules.conf.xml`。已编译的模块仍可能处于未加载状态。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/02-build.md:125
#: 4c78e172d3fd48938077cb6747a38b9f
msgid ""
"`make install` installs vanilla sample config when `$prefix/conf` does "
"not exist (`samples-conf`)."
msgstr "当 `$prefix/conf` 不存在时，`make install` 会安装 vanilla 示例配置（`samples-conf`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/02-build.md:126
#: f35ce92207df4113bc7c5997f12957f7
#, fuzzy
