#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/02-build.md:136
#: 2f0d6de63a9441b7842b8b3f7ff8350d
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A working process prints a line starting with `UP`. Stop with "
"`\"$HOME/fs/bin/freeswitch\" -stop`. Vanilla is a **demo PBX**, not "
"production: SIP users `1000`–`1019` share password `1234`; the `fs_cli` "
"client targets `127.0.0.1:8021` by default, while vanilla ESL listens on "
"wildcard `::`:8021 with password `ClueCon`. Start with `-nonat` unless "
"you want UPnP NAT helpers. First-call steps: [Quick Start](../0.getting-"
"started/02-quick-start.md)."
msgstr ""
"正常运行的进程会输出以 `UP` 开头的一行。使用 `\"$HOME/fs/bin/freeswitch\" -stop` 停止。Vanilla "
"是**演示 PBX**，不是生产配置：SIP 用户 `1000`–`1019` 共用密码 `1234`；`fs_cli` 客户端默认连接 "
"`127.0.0.1:8021`，而 vanilla ESL 在通配 `::`:8021 上监听，密码为 `ClueCon`。除非需要 UPnP "
"NAT 辅助，否则请使用 `-nonat` 启动。首次呼叫步骤见[快速开始](01-quick-start.md)。"

